~ start
Starhead: [center]Oh, finally! My loyal fan has arrived to bathe in the rays of my [nervous]grandiosity[/nervous]![/center]
Starhead: [center]You've made the only right choice in your miserable life — to worship me.[/center]
Starhead: [center]For nothing, hear me? Nothing in all this dull universe compares to my [nervous]enormous[/nervous] greatness.[/center]
Starhead: [center]Go now, my fan, and see why my telescope isn't working.[/center]
Starhead: [center]I was running the assembly instruction projection... But I am too great to deal with such things.[/center]
do ProgressionManager.set_flag("level_2_visited", true)
=> END

~ waiting_telescope
Starhead: [center]Are you still here? And my telescope is still dead?[/center]
Starhead: [center]I'm beginning to doubt if you are even worthy of being in my [nervous]enormous[/nervous] presence.[/center]
Starhead: [center]Even my genius mind suggests you should pay attention to the projector channels... Move it![/center]
=> END

~ after_telescope
Starhead: [center]Hm, the telescope is alive. Another proof that under my leadership even mediocrity can be useful.[/center]
Starhead: [center]What's next? I think I saw further assembly instructions near the mirror of my infinitely deep soul.[/center]
Starhead: [center]Go and find it, my little assistant.[/center]
=> END

~ after_puzzle
Starhead: [center]Attention! I have been visited by sudden inspiration! My mind is birthing a masterpiece![/center]
Starhead: [center]Urgent! Find paper and write under my dictation! Every word of mine is worth its weight in nuggets![/center]
=> END

~ trade_item
Starhead: [center]Give it here! This... this is my greatest creation! It is worthy of the best reward for my fan.[/center]
Starhead: [center]Here, take this — a humble personification of my [nervous]enormous[/nervous] inner world.[/center]
do Global.player_inventory.remove_item_by_path("res://root/assets/items/paper_text.tres")
do Global.player_inventory.add_item_by_path("res://root/assets/items/planet.tres")
do ProgressionManager.set_flag("planet_picked_up", true)
=> END

~ post_trade
Starhead: [center]God, this is so genius... I'm even delighted by myself![/center]
Starhead: [center]Every letter, every stroke... Absolute perfection![/center]
=> END
